  /// placeholders: {shop.VatPercent} = shop.VatPercent (decimal)
  /// beside: "220px"
  text "Cards sold now are single-purpose vouchers: their VAT ({shop.VatPercent} %) is paid when they are sold, and none when they are spent. Change it in the settings." => "البطاقات المباعة الآن قسائم أحادية الغرض: تُدفع ضريبتها ({shop.VatPercent} %) عند بيعها، ولا شيء عند استخدامها. غيّر ذلك في الإعدادات.";
  /// DeskGiftCards · text on the page
  /// beside: "Give store credit instead"
  text "For goodwill — a sorry, a thank-you — a discount code or store credit is usually simpler. A gift card given away is still a multi-purpose voucher: what it pays for carries its VAT when it is spent." => "لحسن النية، كاعتذار أو شكر، يكون رمز الخصم أو رصيد المتجر أبسط عادةً. بطاقة الهدية الممنوحة مجانًا تبقى قسيمة متعددة الأغراض: ما تُدفع به يخضع لضريبته عند استخدامها.";
  /// DeskGiftCards · text on the page
  text "No gift cards yet." => "لا بطاقات هدية بعد.";
  /// DeskGiftCards · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {showing.Currency} = showing.Currency (string), {MoneyIn} = MoneyIn(…) (string), {shop.Currency} = shop.Currency (string), {showing.SentTo} = showing.SentTo (string)
  text "The shop no longer sells in {showing.Currency}, so this card cannot be spent. Reissued, what is left becomes {MoneyIn} on a new card in {shop.Currency} — at the rate it was sold at, so nothing is gained or lost — of the same kind and valid to the same day. The old code stops working; the new one is mailed to {showing.SentTo}." => "لم يعد المتجر يبيع بـ {showing.Currency}، فلا يمكن استخدام هذه البطاقة. عند إعادة إصدارها يصبح المتبقي {MoneyIn} على بطاقة جديدة بـ {shop.Currency}، بسعر الصرف الذي بيعت به، فلا ربح ولا خسارة، ومن النوع نفسه وصالحة حتى اليوم نفسه. يتوقف الرمز القديم عن العمل، ويُرسل الجديد إلى {showing.SentTo}.";
  /// DeskGiftCards · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {MoneyIn} = MoneyIn(…) (string)
  /// beside: "Open"
  text "{MoneyIn} left" => "المتبقي {MoneyIn}";
  /// DeskGiftCards · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {r.Currency} = r.Currency (string)
  text "{r.Currency} is no longer sold — it cannot be spent until it is reissued." => "لم تعد {r.Currency} عملة بيع، فلا يمكن استخدام البطاقة حتى يُعاد إصدارها.";
  /// DeskGiftCards · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {r.SentTo} = r.SentTo (string), {r.Source} = r.Source (string), {r.ValidUntil} = r.ValidUntil (string), {value} = … (string)
  text "{r.SentTo} · {r.Source} · until {r.ValidUntil}{value}" => "{r.SentTo} · {r.Source} · حتى {r.ValidUntil}{value}";
  /// DeskGiftCards · a title
  /// placeholders: {showing.Ending} = showing.Ending (string)
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "Gift card ending {showing.Ending}" => "بطاقة هدية تنتهي بـ {showing.Ending}";
  /// DeskGiftCards · a title
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "Issue a gift card" => "إصدار بطاقة هدية";

