  // ── ShopListConfirmation ──
  /// ShopListConfirmation · the preview line an inbox shows beside an email's subject
  /// shown through ShopMailLayout.preview
  mailPreview "One press and you are on the list." => "ضغطة واحدة وتنضم إلى القائمة.";
  /// ShopListConfirmation · text on the page
  /// shown through EmailNote.text
  /// beside: "Please confirm your address", "Confirm my subscription"
  text "The link works for seven days. If you did not ask, ignore this mail and nothing more will come." => "يعمل الرابط لمدة سبعة أيام. إن لم تطلب ذلك فتجاهل هذه الرسالة ولن يصلك شيء آخر.";
  /// ShopListConfirmation · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {list.Name} = list.Name (string), {reader.Email} = reader.Email (string)
  /// shown through EmailText.text
  /// beside: "Please confirm your address", "Confirm my subscription", "The link works for seven days. If you did not ask, ignore this mail and nothing more will come."
  text "You asked for {list.Name} at {reader.Email}. Press the button to confirm it is you." => "طلبت الاشتراك في {list.Name} على {reader.Email}. اضغط الزر لتأكيد أنك صاحب الطلب.";

  // ── ShopMailLayout ──
  /// ShopMailLayout · text in an email
  /// placeholders: {shop.ContactEmail} = shop.ContactEmail (string)
  /// shown through EmailLayout.footer
  mailText "Questions? Reply to this mail, or write to {shop.ContactEmail}." => "لديك أسئلة؟ رد على هذه الرسالة، أو راسلنا على {shop.ContactEmail}.";

  // ── ShopMailOrderLines ──
  /// ShopMailOrderLines · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~42 characters
  /// placeholders: {g.Last4} = g.Last4 (string)
  /// shown through EmailRow.label
  label "Paid with gift card …{g.Last4}" => "مدفوع ببطاقة هدية …{g.Last4}";
  /// ShopMailOrderLines · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {OrderMoney} = OrderMoney(…) (string), {OrderMoney2} = OrderMoney(…) (string)
  /// shown through EmailNote.text
  text "Gift cards ({OrderMoney}) are single-purpose vouchers: their VAT, {OrderMoney2}, is paid now, and nothing more when they are spent." => "بطاقات الهدية ({OrderMoney}) قسائم أحادية الغرض: تُدفع ضريبتها، {OrderMoney2}، الآن، ولا شيء آخر عند استخدامها.";
  /// ShopMailOrderLines · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {OrderMoney} = OrderMoney(…) (string)
  /// shown through EmailNote.text
  text "Gift cards ({OrderMoney}) carry no VAT — it is paid on what they buy." => "لا تخضع بطاقات الهدية ({OrderMoney}) لضريبة القيمة المضافة، إذ تُدفع الضريبة على ما يُشترى بها.";
  /// ShopMailOrderLines · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {OrderMoney} = OrderMoney(…) (string), {OrderMoney2} = OrderMoney(…) (string)
  /// shown through EmailNote.text
  text "{OrderMoney} was paid with a single-purpose gift card: its VAT, {OrderMoney2}, was paid when the card was bought, so none is charged on it here." => "دُفع {OrderMoney} ببطاقة هدية أحادية الغرض: دُفعت ضريبتها، {OrderMoney2}، عند شراء البطاقة، فلا تُحتسب عليها ضريبة هنا.";

