  button "Keep it" => "الإبقاء عليه";
  /// ShopMyData · a link · at most ~28 characters
  /// shown through TextLink.label
  link "Open the file (JSON)" => "فتح الملف (JSON)";
  /// ShopMyData · message
  /// shown through Alert.message
  message "Your account is erased. You can no longer sign in and will not be mailed; paid orders stay in the shop's books for the period the law requires." => "تم حذف حسابك. لم يعد بإمكانك تسجيل الدخول ولن تصلك رسائل؛ وتبقى الطلبات المدفوعة في سجلات المتجر للمدة التي يقتضيها القانون.";
  /// ShopMyData · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "This cannot be undone, and you are signed out." => "لا يمكن التراجع عن ذلك، وسيُسجَّل خروجك.";
  /// ShopMyData · text on the page
  /// shown through SectionLabel.text
  /// beside: "Your details, your orders and where they went, your returns and what we have mailed you — as a file."
  text "A copy of your data" => "نسخة من بياناتك";
  /// ShopMyData · text on the page
  /// shown through SectionLabel.text
  /// beside: "Your sign-in, email and phone are removed for good, and the shop stops mailing you. On orders you paid for, the name and address the invoice was made out to stay in the shop's books for as long as the bookkeeping law requires — then they go too.", "Erase my account…"
  text "Erase your account" => "حذف حسابك";
  /// ShopMyData · text on the page
  /// beside: "A copy of your data"
  text "Your details, your orders and where they went, your returns and what we have mailed you — as a file." => "بياناتك، وطلباتك وأين أُرسلت، ومرتجعاتك، وما أرسلناه إليك من رسائل، في ملف واحد.";
  /// ShopMyData · text on the page
  /// beside: "Erase your account", "Erase my account…"
  text "Your sign-in, email and phone are removed for good, and the shop stops mailing you. On orders you paid for, the name and address the invoice was made out to stay in the shop's books for as long as the bookkeeping law requires — then they go too." => "يُحذف اسم الدخول والبريد الإلكتروني والهاتف نهائيًا، ويتوقف المتجر عن مراسلتك. أما في الطلبات التي دفعتها، فيبقى الاسم والعنوان اللذان صدرت بهما الفاتورة في سجلات المتجر طوال المدة التي يقتضيها قانون المحاسبة، ثم يُحذفان أيضًا.";
  /// ShopMyData · a title
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "Erase your account?" => "حذف حسابك؟";

