  /// ShopOrderHistory · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "Choose what you would like instead. We set it aside now and send it once yours is back with us." => "اختر ما تريده بدلًا منه. نحجزه لك الآن ونرسله فور عودة منتجك إلينا.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  /// also in ShopOrderByLink
  subtitle "Pack it with the order number inside. We refund what comes back once it arrives." => "غلّفه مع رقم الطلب داخل الطرد. نسترد لك قيمة ما يعود فور وصوله.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  text "Bring it back to the shop — the returns policy says where." => "أعده إلى المتجر. وتوضح سياسة الإرجاع المكان.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  /// shown through problem
  text "Choose what you would like instead." => "اختر ما تريده بدلًا منه.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
