  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {MoneyIn} = MoneyIn(…) (string), {value} = … (string)
  text "It costs {MoneyIn} less. {value}" => "سعره أقل بـ {MoneyIn}. {value}";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {MoneyIn} = MoneyIn(…) (string)
  text "It costs {MoneyIn} more. We send you a link to pay the difference once yours is back." => "سعره أعلى بـ {MoneyIn}. سنرسل إليك رابطًا لدفع الفرق فور عودة منتجك.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  text "Nothing else of it is in stock just now. Search for something else." => "لا يتوفر منه شيء آخر حاليًا. ابحث عن منتج آخر.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  text "Post it back to the shop yourself, with the order number inside — the returns policy says where." => "أرسله بنفسك بالبريد إلى المتجر، مع رقم الطلب داخل الطرد. وتوضح سياسة الإرجاع العنوان.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  /// shown through SectionLabel.text
  /// also in ShopPolicy
  /// also in ShopReturnsPage /staff/returns
  /// also in ShopOrderByLink
  text "Returns" => "المرتجعات";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  text "The difference goes back the way you paid." => "يُعاد الفرق بالطريقة التي دفعت بها.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  text "The difference goes to your store credit." => "يُضاف الفرق إلى رصيدك في المتجر.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  text "The same price. Nothing more to pay." => "السعر نفسه. لا شيء إضافي للدفع.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  /// shown through EmptyState.body
  text "What you buy while signed in is kept here." => "ما تشتريه أثناء تسجيل الدخول يُحفظ هنا.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  text "You asked for store credit instead of the money back." => "طلبت رصيدًا في المتجر بدلًا من استرداد المبلغ.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {order.ExchangeFor.Reference} = order.ExchangeFor.Reference (string)
  text "Your exchange for order {order.ExchangeFor.Reference}." => "البديل للطلب {order.ExchangeFor.Reference}.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {order.ExchangeFor.Reference} = order.ExchangeFor.Reference (string)
  text "Your exchange for order {order.ExchangeFor.Reference}. We send it once what you are sending back is with us." => "البديل للطلب {order.ExchangeFor.Reference}. نرسله إليك فور وصول ما ترجعه إلينا.";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {MoneyIn} = MoneyIn(…) (string)
  text "{MoneyIn} of it paid with store credit" => "دُفع {MoneyIn} منه برصيد المتجر";
  /// ShopOrderHistory · text on the page
