  /// placeholders: {shop.Name} = shop.Name (string)
  /// shown through EmailText.text
  /// beside: "Reset your password", "Choose a new password", "The link works once, for an hour. If you did not ask, ignore this mail and nothing changes."
  text "Somebody — hopefully you — asked to reset the password for your {shop.Name} account." => "طلب شخص ما، ونأمل أن تكون أنت، إعادة تعيين كلمة مرور حسابك في {shop.Name}.";
  /// ShopPasswordResetMail · text on the page
  /// shown through EmailNote.text
  /// beside: "Reset your password", "Choose a new password"
  text "The link works once, for an hour. If you did not ask, ignore this mail and nothing changes." => "يعمل الرابط مرة واحدة، لمدة ساعة. إن لم تطلب ذلك فتجاهل هذه الرسالة ولن يتغير شيء.";

